Description: Automated power management for Proxmox hosts with Windows VMs and GPU passthrough.
 Hibernates Windows VMs and shuts down LXC containers before host sleep, then
 resumes them after wake. Any number of VMs and containers can be managed, each
 with its own sleep action. Includes idle monitoring to auto-sleep when the
 system is inactive.

